Q3. Difference between Strategy Pattern
and Factory Method Pattern

Interview Ready Answer

Strategy Pattern

• Behavioral Design Pattern.
• Focuses on Algorithm Selection.
• Defines multiple
  interchangeable algorithms.
• Client selects one strategy
  at runtime.
• Removes if-else statements.

------------------------------------------------------------

Factory Method Pattern

• Creational Design Pattern.
• Focuses on Object Creation.
• Creates objects without
  exposing the concrete class.
• Factory decides which object
  to create.
• Encapsulates object creation logic.

------------------------------------------------------------

